{"id":"4850","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4850_main_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>一股南风气流为香港（中国）附近的广东沿岸带来炎热多雨的天气。密集的云是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密</span>卷云，是积雨云的残余部分 - 这可进一步将其定义为人为积雨云性。在地平线上可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">秃积雨云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Moon Tong Tsang","location":"中国香港赤鱲角","latitude":"纬度: 22° 18' 56'' N","longitude":"经度: 113° 55' 21'' E","date":"14 June 2015 0536 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 3, CM= 3, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.5"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/4850_syn_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"></div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/4850_upper_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"></div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5505_main_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbogentitus-and-cumulus-mediocris_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>仍为砧状，该<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性密卷云</span>是大约45分钟前一个小而孤立的砧状鬃积雨云的余云。</p>\n<p>积云，主要为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中展</span>云种，可完成云观测。</p>\n<p>这是放大的图像。详见附图。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰，赫尔辛基","latitude":"纬度: 60° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 25° 0' 0'' E","date":"08 July 2011 1450 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.5"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5506_main_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbigenitus-and-cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>仍为砧形，该<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性密卷云</span>是大约45分钟前一个小而孤立的砧状鬃积雨云的余云。在发展的衰退阶段，新的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状鬃积雨云</span>在左侧地平线约60公里外。在该单体的侧面是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>单体或<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云</span>单体；由于单体距离远且相对较小，无法根据本图做出准确识别。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中展</span>云种为主的积云可完成云观测。右侧缩放的单体图像参见附图。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰，赫尔辛基","latitude":"纬度: 60° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 25° 0' 0'' E","date":"08 July 2011 1449 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.5"}]}]}